tions, formalized by the International Astronomical Union, elevate her from a historical figure to a permanent fixture of our solar system. This scientific naming convention echoes her cultural status: just as her mausoleum defines architectural history on Earth, these craters ensure her name endures across the cosmos. Id X.", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T17:42:01Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "mumtaz?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T17:42:01Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Mimtaz", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T17:42:02Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "taj", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T17:42:07Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "Mumtaz Mahal", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T17:42:10Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Arjumand banu begam", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T17:42:19Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "What a lurn !", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T17:42:27Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Mumtaz Mahal is correct. Born on this day in 1593", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T17:42:38Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Nikhil 20 Pavan 20", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T17:42:57Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Is slow internet ka kuch karna padega", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-27T17:43:03Z", "us